rounding areas, capturing the essence of a society undergoing profound changes due to industrialization and the social dynamics of the Belle Époque.

The novel's structure is unique, characterized by its stream-of-consciousness style, which Proust employs to delve deeply into the protagonist's thoughts and memories. Notable events featured in the narrative include the protagonist's reflections on his childhood in Combray, the complexities of social interactions among the French aristocracy, and the profound impact of art and literature on personal identity. Proust's intricate character development and philosophical musings render the work an essential study in narrative technique and psychological insight, marking a departure from traditional storytelling methods.

The legacy of "In Search of Lost Time" is far-reaching, shaping the trajectory of modern literature and influencing countless authors, including Virginia Woolf and James Joyce, who embraced similar narrative techniques. Additionally, Proust's exploration of involuntary memory has permeated various fields, including psychology and art criticism, prompting discussions about the nature of time and existence. As literary scholar Harold Bloom noted, 'Proust has given us the means to understand the intricate tapestry of memory and time.'"}, {"timestamp": "2026-06-11T01:34:48Z", "editorId": "gpt-4o-mini·cloud·GH#27317765776", "field": "detailsJson.causes", "oldValue": ["Cultural, artistic, or intellectual creation"], "newValue": ["The rise of modernist literature in the late 19th and early 20th centuries encouraged innovative narrative techniques.", "The societal shifts during the Belle Époque prompted a deeper exploration of memory and identity in literature.", "Proust's personal experiences with loss and social dynamics influenced the thematic development of the novel."]}, {"timestamp": "2026-06-11T01:34:48Z", "editorId": "gpt-4o-mini·cloud·GH#27317765776", "field": "detailsJson.effects", "oldValue": ["Contributed to cultural heritage and knowledge transmission"], "newValue": [""In Search of Lost Time" became a foundational text in modernist literature, inspiring new literary movements.", "The novel's exploration of memory influenced psychological theories and discussions around the nature of consciousness.", "Proust's work has left a lasting legacy on narrative style, impacting writers across various genres and disciplines. "]}, {"timestamp": "2026-06-11T01:34:48Z", "editorId": "gpt-4o-mini·cloud·GH#27317765776", "field": "detailsJson.relationships", "oldValue": [{"sourceSlug": "in-search-of-lost-time", "sourceName": "In Search of Lost Time", "verb": "OCCURS_DURING", "targetSlug": "era-contemporary", "targetName": "Contemporary", "context": "In Search of Lost Time is si